    "id": "bihar-deled-admission-2026-20-aug-merit-list-dates-admission-details",
    "title": "Bihar DElEd Admission 2026: 20 Aug Merit List, Dates & Admission Details",
    "summary": "Bihar DElEd Admission 2026: Application Begins, First Merit List on August 20 – Check Full Counselling Schedule Bihar DElEd Admission 2026: The wait is finally over for thousands of aspiring teachers in Bihar. The Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) has officially started the DElEd admission process. Now, candidates who have cleared the entrance exam must [...]",
    "content": "Bihar DElEd Admission 2026: Application Begins, First Merit List on August 20 – Check Full Counselling Schedule\n\nBihar DElEd Admission 2026: The wait is finally over for thousands of aspiring teachers in Bihar. The Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) has officially started the DElEd admission process. Now, candidates who have cleared the entrance exam must act quickly to secure their seats in recognised teacher training institutes across the state.\n\nThe biggest update is that the first merit list for Bihar DElEd Admission 2026 will be released on August 20, 2026. After that, shortlisted candidates will get a limited window to complete their admission formalities.\n\nTherefore, if you have qualified for the Bihar DElEd Joint Entrance Exam 2026, do not delay. Timely choice filling and application submission are now crucial.\n\nBihar DElEd Admission 2026: Online Application Process Begins\n\nThe Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) has officially activated the counselling and admission process for successful candidates.\n\nApplicants must complete the online process to apply for admission to recognised DElEd training institutes across Bihar.\n\nFirst, candidates need to visit the official portal. Then, they must fill in their personal and academic details carefully. After that, they need to pay the required application fee online.\n\nIn addition, candidates must select their preferred institutes. These choices will play a key role in the final seat allotment process.\n\nDirect Bihar DElEd Counselling Application Link\n\nCandidates who have qualified for the entrance examination can complete the counselling process through the official DElEd portal.\n\n👉 Click Here to Apply for Bihar DElEd Counselling 2026\n\nThe application window remains open until August 16, 2026. Candidates should complete registration, fee payment, and college choice filling before the deadline.\n\nImportant: Always verify the official portal before entering login details or personal information.\n\nHow Will Selection Be Done?\n\nBSEB will prepare the merit list based on two key factors:\n\nMarks obtained in the DElEd entrance examination\n\nCollege and institute preferences filled by candidates\n\nTherefore, choice filling is not just a formality. It can directly affect your admission and seat allotment.\n\nCandidates should select their preferences carefully. Before submitting the form, they should also double-check every detail.\n\nApply Before August 16, 2026\n\nThe last date to complete the Bihar DElEd Admission 2026 application process is August 16, 2026.\n\nThis means candidates have limited time left.\n\nSo, waiting until the final day can be risky. Heavy website traffic, payment failures, or technical issues may cause unnecessary trouble.\n\nTo avoid such problems, complete the application early. After submission, verify the payment status and save a copy of the submitted form.\n\nFirst Merit List on August 20, 2026\n\nThe most awaited stage of counselling is almost here.\n\nThe first merit list will be released on August 20, 2026, according to the announced schedule.\n\nIf your name appears on the list, you must proceed with the admission formalities without delay.\n\nSelected candidates will have to complete admission between August 20 and August 24, 2026, at their allotted institutes.\n\nTherefore, once the list is released, check your allotment carefully. Also, keep the required documents ready in advance.\n\nSecond Merit List: Key Date\n\nIf you are not selected in the first round, there is still another opportunity.\n\nThe second merit list will be released on August 29, 2026.\n\nCandidates selected in this round will be able to complete admission between August 29 and September 1, 2026.\n\nThis round can give another chance to candidates who do not secure a seat in the first list. However, they must follow the official instructions and deadlines.\n\nThird Merit List Schedule\n\nThe counselling process will then move into its third phase.\n\nThe third merit list will be released on September 5, 2026.\n\nCandidates selected in this list can complete admission between September 5 and September 7, 2026.\n\nTherefore, candidates who miss the first two rounds should continue checking the official portal for updates.\n\nBihar DElEd Counselling 2026: Complete Schedule\n\nProcess\nDate\n\nLast date to apply\nAugust 16, 2026\n\nFirst Merit List\nAugust 20, 2026\n\nAdmission from First List\nAugust 20–24, 2026\n\nSeat update by institutes\nBy August 25, 2026\n\nSecond Merit List\nAugust 29, 2026\n\nAdmission from Second List\nAugust 29–September 1, 2026\n\nThird Merit List\nSeptember 5, 2026\n\nAdmission from Third List\nSeptember 5–7, 2026\n\nImportant Instructions for Candidates\n\nCandidates must stay alert throughout the admission process. Even a small mistake can create problems later.\n\nFirst, complete the application before the deadline. Then, confirm your payment status.\n\nNext, choose your college preferences wisely. Your choices can influence the seat allotment process.\n\nAfter that, regularly check the official portal for updates. Do not rely entirely on social media posts or unofficial information.\n\nFinally, once a merit list appears, check your allotment and admission deadline immediately.\n\nWhat Should You Do Now?\n\nIf you have qualified for the entrance exam, your next priority should be counselling.\n\nFirst, complete your application and fee payment. Then, carefully fill in your college preferences.\n\nAfter that, wait for the first merit list on August 20. If selected, complete your admission between August 20 and August 24.\n\nIf your name does not appear, stay prepared for the second and third merit lists.\n\nRemember, missing a deadline could mean missing your admission opportunity.\n\nStay Updated with Bihar Education News\n\nFor the latest updates on education, careers, admissions, and important developments in Bihar, follow Bihar Say.\n\nBihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform. It highlights powerful stories on culture, business, and grassroots transformation across the state.\n\nWith a growing community of 14,000+ followers worldwide, Bihar Say is helping reshape Bihar’s digital image. It also generates strong engagement through Bihar-focused content on LinkedIn and other platforms.\n\nIn addition, Bihar Say has partnered with platforms such as DailyHunt to expand its reach.\n\nIts flagship podcast and video series, BiharCast, brings untold stories from Bihar to a wider audience. The series features changemakers, traditions, and rising voices from across the state.\n\n👉 For more updates on Bihar DElEd Admission 2026, merit lists, counselling news, education alerts, and Bihar stories, visit www.biharsay.com and become part of the growing 13,000+ Bihar Say community worldwide.",
