    "id": "new-policy-to-launch-international-flights-from-patna-and-gaya",
    "title": "New Policy to Launch International Flights from Patna and Gaya",
    "summary": "“Bihar Takes Off Globally: International Flights from Patna & Gaya Set to Transform Travel, Trade & Tourism” A New Dawn for Bihar’s Global Connectivity Imagine boarding an international flight directly from Bihar—no layovers, no long detours. That vision is finally turning into reality. The Bihar government has introduced a bold new destination policy, and as [...]",
    "content": "“Bihar Takes Off Globally: International Flights from Patna & Gaya Set to Transform Travel, Trade & Tourism”\n\nA New Dawn for Bihar’s Global Connectivity\n\nImagine boarding an international flight directly from Bihar—no layovers, no long detours. That vision is finally turning into reality. The Bihar government has introduced a bold new destination policy, and as a result, international travel from the state is set to become easier, faster, and far more accessible.\n\nThis move signals a powerful shift. Not only will it simplify journeys, but it will also reshape Bihar’s global identity.\n\nPolicy Push: What’s Changing Now\n\nThe government has officially approved a new destination policy to expand international air connectivity. Moreover, this policy offers financial incentives and operational support to airlines.\n\nAs a result, more aviation companies will now consider launching routes from Bihar. This step aims to reduce dependency on metro cities like Delhi or Kolkata.\n\nAdditionally, the policy ensures faster approvals and smoother onboarding for airlines. Therefore, the execution process becomes quicker and more efficient.\n\nFocus Airports: Jay Prakash Narayan International Airport & Gaya International Airport\n\nThe government has placed strong focus on two major airports—Patna and Gaya.\n\nThese airports will act as Bihar’s international gateways. Authorities have already initiated processes to expand routes from these hubs.\n\nFurthermore, Gaya holds strategic importance due to Buddhist tourism. Meanwhile, Patna serves as a major urban and economic center.\n\nInternational Destinations on the Radar\n\nIn the initial phase, flights will connect Bihar to key global cities. These include:\n\nKathmandu\n\nSharjah\n\nBangkok\n\nColombo\n\nSingapore\n\nThis expansion will drastically reduce travel time. More importantly, it will eliminate the need to travel to other states first.\n\nTender Timeline & Airline Participation\n\nThe government has already started the tender process.\n\nTender release: March 25, 2026\n\nPre-bid meeting: April 7, 2026\n\nLast date to apply: April 15, 2026\n\nOnly airlines approved by the Directorate General of Civil Aviation (DGCA) can participate.\n\nThis requirement ensures safety standards and service quality remain high.\n\nWhy This Move Matters for Bihar\n\nThis policy goes beyond travel convenience. In fact, it opens doors to economic transformation.\n\nTourism will grow rapidly, especially religious tourism in Gaya\n\nTrade opportunities will expand across Southeast Asia and the Middle East\n\nInvestors will find Bihar more accessible\n\nJob creation will increase in aviation and allied sectors\n\nMoreover, improved connectivity builds confidence. It shows that Bihar is ready to compete on a global stage.\n\nA Step Towards a Stronger Bihar\n\nClearly, this initiative reflects a forward-thinking vision. It connects Bihar to global markets while empowering its people.\n\nAt the same time, it reduces migration pressure for travel needs. Consequently, residents can access international opportunities from their home state itself.\n\nStay Connected with Bihar’s Growth Story\n\nThis is just the beginning of Bihar’s global journey.\n\n👉 Follow www.biharsay.com for more such powerful updates👉 Become part of the 13K+ global community\n\nBihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical storytelling platform. It reshapes the state’s image through impactful stories on culture, business, and grassroots change.\n\nWith 13,000+ followers, strong LinkedIn reach, and collaborations with platforms like DailyHunt, Bihar Say stands as the digital voice of Bihar.\n\n🎙️ Its flagship series BiharCast brings untold stories and changemakers into the spotlight.",
