    "id": "bihar-petc-scheme-free-coaching-%e2%82%b93000-monthly-for-competitive-exam-aspirants",
    "title": "Bihar PETC Scheme: Free Coaching + ₹3,000 Monthly for Competitive Exam Aspirants",
    "summary": "Free Coaching, ₹3,000 Every Month, and a Real Chance to Crack Competitive Exams — Bihar’s PETC Scheme Is Changing Futures What if your dream of becoming an officer, banker, or government employee came with free coaching, expert guidance, and ₹3,000 every month?In Bihar, this is no longer a promise. Instead, it is a reality transforming [...]",
    "content": "Free Coaching, ₹3,000 Every Month, and a Real Chance to Crack Competitive Exams — Bihar’s PETC Scheme Is Changing Futures\n\nWhat if your dream of becoming an officer, banker, or government employee came with free coaching, expert guidance, and ₹3,000 every month?In Bihar, this is no longer a promise. Instead, it is a reality transforming thousands of lives.\n\nBihar PETC Program: Turning Dreams into Action\n\nThe Bihar Pre-Examination Training Centre (PETC) Scheme is empowering students from Backward and Extremely Backward Classes to prepare for competitive exams without financial stress.\n\nMore importantly, the Bihar government designed this program to remove two major barriers—lack of money and lack of guidance. As a result, aspirants can now focus fully on preparation.\n\nCurrently, 38 PETC centres across 36 districts are actively training students. Consequently, thousands of young minds are moving closer to careers in civil services, SSC, banking, railways, and other government jobs.\n\nWhat Makes PETC a Game-Changer for Aspirants\n\nUnlike private coaching institutes, PETC offers structured preparation at zero cost. Moreover, it ensures accountability and quality learning.\n\nKey Facilities Provided Under PETC\n\n6 months of completely free coaching\n\nTwo batches per centre, with 60 students in each batch\n\n₹3,000 monthly incentive, provided 75% attendance is maintained\n\nDigital classrooms for modern learning\n\nWell-equipped libraries for self-study\n\nRegular motivation and guidance sessions\n\nFree syllabus-based study material\n\nExperienced and subject-specialist teachers\n\nBecause of these facilities, students gain both confidence and clarity. Additionally, the monthly incentive helps cover daily expenses during preparation.\n\nWho Can Apply for Bihar PETC Coaching\n\nThe program follows clear eligibility rules. Therefore, deserving candidates receive priority.\n\nEligibility Criteria\n\nApplicant must be a permanent resident of Bihar\n\nCandidate should belong to Backward Class (BC) or Extremely Backward Class (EBC)\n\nAnnual family income must not exceed ₹3 lakh\n\nAdmission is granted through an entrance exam or academic merit\n\nAs a result, students from economically weaker backgrounds finally get a level playing field.\n\nExpert Insight: Why PETC Is Working\n\nAccording to Satyendra Dutt Mishra, Director of Patna University PETC, the impact is visible and measurable.\n\nHe explains that free education combined with correct guidance has helped students set bigger goals. Furthermore, regular mentoring has improved discipline and exam readiness.\n\nBecause of this structured approach, many aspirants now believe in themselves again.\n\nWhy This Scheme Matters Beyond Exams\n\nPETC is not just about clearing exams. Instead, it is about social mobility, dignity, and equal opportunity.\n\nMoreover, it reduces dependency on expensive coaching hubs outside Bihar. Consequently, talent stays local while ambitions go national.\n\nMost importantly, PETC proves that government-backed education models can deliver results when implemented sincerely.\n\nFinal Call to Action\n\nIf you want more such credible Bihar News, development updates, and human stories that truly matter—👉 Follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 13,000+ strong global community.\n\nBihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the state’s image through stories on culture, business, policy, and grassroots change.With top LinkedIn impressions for Bihar-focused content, partnerships with DailyHunt, and its flagship podcast BiharCast, Bihar Say continues to amplify voices from the heart of Bihar.\n\nStay informed. Stay inspired. Stay connected with Bihar Say.",
