    "id": "bihar-sports-scholarship-2026-%e2%82%b920-lakh-aid-for-athletes",
    "title": "Bihar Sports Scholarship 2026: ₹20 Lakh Aid for Athletes",
    "summary": "From Dreams to Podiums: Bihar Government Announces ₹20 Lakh Sports Scholarship for Athletes in 2026 What if talent never lost a medal because of money?In 2026, Bihar is making that promise real. As the new year approaches, the Bihar government has delivered one of its biggest gifts to young athletes. Through an expanded Bihar Sports [...]",
    "content": "From Dreams to Podiums: Bihar Government Announces ₹20 Lakh Sports Scholarship for Athletes in 2026\n\nWhat if talent never lost a medal because of money?In 2026, Bihar is making that promise real.\n\nAs the new year approaches, the Bihar government has delivered one of its biggest gifts to young athletes. Through an expanded Bihar Sports Scholarship 2026, players can now receive financial support ranging from ₹5 lakh to ₹20 lakh annually. As a result, thousands of aspiring sportspersons finally see a future without financial barriers.\n\nBihar Sports Scholarship 2026: A Game-Changer for Young Athletes\n\nTo begin with, the Bihar government has officially announced the new phase of the ‘Saksham’ and ‘Udaan’ Scholarship Schemes. These initiatives aim to nurture elite talent and build global-level athletes from the state.\n\nAccording to Ravindran Shankaran, Director General of the Bihar State Sports Authority (BSSA), the vision is clear. The government wants players to focus on performance, not expenses. Therefore, the scholarship removes financial stress and promotes international exposure.\n\nMoreover, the schemes operate under the inspiring slogan “Dil Se Khelo, Milkar Jeeto.”Consequently, sports in Bihar are no longer limited to passion alone. They now offer a viable career path.\n\nUnderstanding ‘Saksham’ and ‘Udaan’ Yojana in Bihar\n\nImportantly, both scholarship schemes serve different categories of athletes.\n\nSaksham Yojana: Supporting National-Level Performers\n\nFirst, the Saksham Scholarship targets athletes who have proven themselves at the national stage. This includes participants from National Championships and All India University Games.\n\nUnder this scheme:\n\nAthletes receive up to ₹5 lakh per year\n\nThe support helps with training, equipment, diet, and recovery\n\nThe focus remains on consistency and long-term performance\n\nAs a result, national-level players gain stability and confidence to aim higher.\n\nUdaan Yojana: Fueling International Ambitions\n\nOn the other hand, the Udaan Scholarship focuses on international achievers. Athletes who have represented India at the Olympics, Asian Games, or Commonwealth Games qualify for this elite support.\n\nUnder Udaan:\n\nPlayers receive up to ₹20 lakh annually\n\nFunds support foreign training, international coaching, and advanced nutrition\n\nAthletes can plan global exposure without financial limitations\n\nTherefore, Bihar now actively invests in medal-winning potential.\n\nWho Is Eligible for the Bihar Sports Scholarship?\n\nHowever, not every athlete qualifies automatically. The government has set clear eligibility rules.\n\nTo apply:\n\nThe sport must be officially recognized (Angikrit)\n\nIt must feature in the Olympics, Asian Games, or Commonwealth Games\n\nThe athlete must have ranked:\n\nTop 8 in individual events\n\nTop 4 in team events\n\nNotably, in the previous year, 236 athletes from Bihar received this scholarship. Many of them won medals at national platforms. Hence, expectations for 2026 remain high.\n\nOnline Application Process: Simple, Transparent, Digital\n\nMeanwhile, the application process remains fully online. This ensures transparency and speed.\n\nKey Dates to Remember\n\nApplication Start: 1 January 2026\n\nLast Date: 15 January 2026\n\nAthletes must apply through the official BSSA portal.\n\nDuring registration:\n\nUpload performance certificates\n\nProvide medal details and rankings\n\nSubmit verified competition records\n\nAfterward, an expert committee reviews every application. Only genuine and verified athletes make the final list. Thus, merit stays at the center of selection.\n\nHow the Scholarship Will Transform Bihar’s Sports Culture\n\nBeyond money, this scholarship changes mindsets.\n\nAccording to BSSA officials, financial security motivates athletes to commit fully. Consequently, families now view sports as a serious profession. Additionally, players can invest in:\n\nProfessional coaching\n\nSports science and physiotherapy\n\nHigh-quality equipment\n\nNutrition and recovery programs\n\nOver time, this ecosystem builds champions. Hence, Bihar moves closer to becoming a true sporting powerhouse.\n\nWhy This Scholarship Matters Beyond Sports\n\nMore importantly, this initiative reshapes Bihar’s identity.\n\nFor decades, talented players struggled due to limited resources. Now, the narrative is shifting. Talent meets opportunity. Dreams meet infrastructure. Bihar meets the global sporting stage.\n\nCTA – Stay Connected\n\nFor more such verified Bihar news, sports policy updates, and ground-level stories, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 13,000+ global community.\n\nBihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, reshaping the state’s image through impactful stories on culture, business, sports, and grassroots change. With strong partnerships, top LinkedIn impressions, and its flagship podcast BiharCast, Bihar Say remains the digital voice of Bihar.",
