    "id": "patna-delhi-darbhanga-delhi-special-trains-announced",
    "title": "Patna–Delhi & Darbhanga–Delhi Special Trains Announced",
    "summary": "दिल्ली जाना अब होगा आसान! पटना और दरभंगा से चलेंगी 4 नई स्पेशल ट्रेनें — सीट, सुविधा और समय का पूरा अपडेट When travel stress rises, even a single good update feels like a breath of relief — and this time, Bihar got four reasons to smile! Indian Railways has stepped in with a timely [...]",
    "content": "दिल्ली जाना अब होगा आसान! पटना और दरभंगा से चलेंगी 4 नई स्पेशल ट्रेनें — सीट, सुविधा और समय का पूरा अपडेट\n\nWhen travel stress rises, even a single good update feels like a breath of relief — and this time, Bihar got four reasons to smile!\n\nIndian Railways has stepped in with a timely decision. It has announced four special trains between Patna–Delhi and Darbhanga–Delhi, offering smoother travel, easier seat availability, and reduced festival rush. Let’s break down every important detail so you can plan your journey wisely.\n\nWhy These Special Trains Matter Right Now\n\nThe festival season and heavy passenger load often push Bihar–Delhi routes beyond capacity. Seats vanish quickly. Platforms get crowded. Journeys turn exhausting.\n\nHowever, this new decision changes everything.These four trains will ease the load on key stations like Ara, Buxar, DDU, Muzaffarpur, Samastipur and Hajipur. Moreover, limited stoppages will help passengers reach Delhi faster and more comfortably.\n\nPatna–Delhi Special Trains: Full Schedule & Highlights\n\nIndian Railways will operate two pairs of special trains between Patna and Anand Vihar Terminal in the second week of December.\n\n🔹 Train 02395 (Patna → Delhi)\n\nRuns on 9, 11, 13 December\n\nDeparture: 8:30 PM from Patna\n\nRoute: Danapur → Ara → Buxar → DDU\n\nArrival: 3:00 AM next day, Anand Vihar\n\n🔹 Train 02396 (Delhi → Patna)\n\nRuns on 10, 12, 14 December\n\nDeparture: 7:00 PM from Anand Vihar\n\nArrival: 2:00 PM next day\n\n🔹 Train 02309 (Patna → Delhi)\n\nRuns on 10, 12, 14 December\n\nFollows the same timetable as 02395\n\n🔹 Train 02310 (Delhi → Patna)\n\nRuns on 11, 13, 15 December\n\nThese trains will run with minimal stoppages so passengers save time and travel comfortably.\n\nDarbhanga–Delhi Special Trains: Full Schedule & All You Must Know\n\nMithila region gets its own relief too.Two pairs of special trains will run between Darbhanga and Anand Vihar Terminal.\n\n🔹 Train 05563 (Darbhanga → Delhi)\n\nRuns on 10, 11, 13, 14 December\n\nDeparture: 6:15 PM from Darbhanga\n\nRoute: Samastipur → Muzaffarpur → Hajipur → other key stops\n\nArrival: 9:15 AM next day, Delhi\n\n🔹 Train 05564 (Delhi → Darbhanga)\n\nRuns on 12, 13, 15, 16 December\n\nDeparture: 12:05 AM from Anand Vihar\n\nArrival: 11:00 PM next day\n\n🔹 Train 05565 (Darbhanga → Delhi)\n\nRuns on 9 and 12 December\n\n🔹 Train 05566 (Delhi → Darbhanga)\n\nReturns on 11 and 14 December\n\nWith these trains, passengers will finally experience smoother travel and shorter waiting lists.\n\nWhy This Move Brings Big Relief\n\nPassengers often struggle with last-minute travel during peak rush. However, these special trains offer:\n\nBetter seat availability\n\nLess crowding at key stations\n\nMore convenient travel timings\n\nFaster journeys due to limited stoppages\n\nIn short, the decision brings stability when people need it the most.\n\nStay Updated With Bihar’s Most Trusted Digital Platform\n\nIf you love getting fast and reliable Bihar updates on trains, travel, infrastructure, culture, entrepreneurship, and grassroots stories, then you’re in the right place.\n\nFollow www.biharsay.com for more such regular updates and become part of our 13k+ global community.Bihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform. We’re reshaping Bihar’s image through powerful stories on culture, business, and real change.Our flagship podcast BiharCast dives into untold narratives and rising voices from the heart of Bihar.",
