    "id": "bceceb-declares-bihar-neet-pg-2025-round-1-seat-allotment-result-declared",
    "title": "BCECEB Declares Bihar NEET PG 2025 Round 1 Seat Allotment Result declared",
    "summary": "“Race for Bihar NEET PG 2025 Begins: Top 4 Grab MD Radio-Diagnosis Seats in Round 1” When ambition meets opportunity, Bihar creates stories worth celebrating. Today’s update from @BCECEB has set the medical community buzzing with excitement, hope, and intense competition. Bihar NEET PG 2025 Round 1: A Big Day for Medical Aspirants The Bihar [...]",
    "content": "“Race for Bihar NEET PG 2025 Begins: Top 4 Grab MD Radio-Diagnosis Seats in Round 1”\n\nWhen ambition meets opportunity, Bihar creates stories worth celebrating. Today’s update from @BCECEB has set the medical community buzzing with excitement, hope, and intense competition.\n\nBihar NEET PG 2025 Round 1: A Big Day for Medical Aspirants\n\nThe Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB) released the Round 1 seat allotment result for PGMAC 2025 on its official website. Thousands of candidates rushed to check their status as soon as the update went live on bceceboard.bihar.gov.in.\n\nThe rush felt emotional because every seat carries years of hard work and sacrifice. Moreover, this first round often shapes the direction of a doctor’s career.\n\nInterestingly, the results revealed a clear trend. The top four rankers secured seats in MD Radio-Diagnosis, a speciality now preferred by many toppers nationwide. Meanwhile, six others from the top 10 opted for General Medicine and Obstetrics & Gynaecology, showing how aspirations continue to diversify.\n\nWhat the Allotment Data Says About Changing Preferences\n\nThe choices made by Bihar’s toppers say a lot about shifting goals. Students increasingly prefer specialties that offer sharper learning curves and strong clinical exposure. And Radio-Diagnosis clearly leads that list this year.\n\nAdditionally, general medicine and OBG still hold immense relevance, especially for students who want broad clinical practice. Because of this balance, Round 1 reflects both ambition and practicality.\n\nFurthermore, candidates now show stronger clarity in personal goals, leading to more confident seat selections. Therefore, this trend could continue in upcoming rounds as well.\n\nImportant Dates Every Candidate Must Keep in Mind\n\nThe counselling schedule for PGMAC 2025 is tight and demands quick action.\n\nDownload allotment order: Till December 1\n\nReporting at allotted institutes: November 28 to December 1\n\nAlthough the window is short, it gives enough time for candidates to prepare documents and complete the process smoothly. However, missing the deadline can lead to disqualification from the next rounds. Therefore, early reporting is always better.\n\nHow to Check Bihar NEET PG 2025 Round 1 Seat Allotment\n\nChecking the result is simple. Follow these steps:\n\nVisit bceceboard.bihar.gov.in\n\nClick PGMAC Result under “Download”\n\nOpen the PDF file\n\nSearch your application number\n\nView your allotted seat\n\nThis process takes only a minute, yet it changes the entire course of a doctor’s journey.\n\nA New Chapter for Bihar’s Medical Future\n\nEvery seat in this counselling round contributes to Bihar’s growing medical strength. Moreover, with candidates choosing diverse specializations, the state is preparing for a stronger, more skilled healthcare system.\n\nAnd as Round 2 approaches, thousands more will anxiously wait, prepare, and dream again. Their stories continue to reshape Bihar’s medical future — one result at a time.\n\n👉 For more such real-time, apolitical, deeply humanised updates, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our 13k global community!\n\nBihar Say is Bihar’s leading storytelling and development-focused digital platform — the true voice of a rising Bihar.",
