    "id": "sonpur-mela-2025-special-trains-full-list-timings-travel-guide",
    "title": "Sonpur Mela 2025 Special Trains: Full List, Timings & Travel Guide",
    "summary": "Sonpur Mela 2025: Special Trains, Fresh Buzz & A Smoother Journey Than Ever! If you have ever wanted to feel Bihar’s cultural heartbeat in one place, Sonpur Mela 2025 is calling louder than ever. The energy is rising, the stalls are ready, and now Indian Railways has stepped in to make your journey easier than [...]",
    "content": "Sonpur Mela 2025: Special Trains, Fresh Buzz & A Smoother Journey Than Ever!\n\nIf you have ever wanted to feel Bihar’s cultural heartbeat in one place, Sonpur Mela 2025 is calling louder than ever. The energy is rising, the stalls are ready, and now Indian Railways has stepped in to make your journey easier than before.\n\nThis year, the Railway Department has arranged Special Trains to ensure thousands of travellers reach the fairground without stress. And that single update has already sparked excitement across Bhojpur, Arrah, and nearby districts.\n\nWhy Sonpur Mela Still Rules the Hearts of Bihar\n\nSonpur Mela is not just a fair. It is an emotion.People from Bhojpur have visited it for generations. Earlier, visitors even travelled by boats because no other options existed. However, things have changed beautifully. Now, families plan their trips days in advance, and they prefer the comfort, safety, and affordability of trains.\n\nThe fair once again shines as a top attraction. Moreover, the festive atmosphere pulls people of every age. Many families want to explore the mela, taste the food, enjoy rides, and catch live cultural shows.\n\nTrain Travel: The Smartest Way to Reach Sonpur Mela 2025\n\nTravelling by train to Sonpur is not only easy. It is also the fastest and most convenient way, especially during the mela rush.From Ara Junction, several trains run straight to Hajipur and Sonpur via Danapur and Patliputra.\n\nSince Hajipur Station sits very close to the mela ground, you can reach the venue within minutes after arriving.Additionally, train travel saves you from heavy traffic, roadblocks, and long delays.\n\nMany people prefer starting early. They travel in the morning, enjoy the fair all day, and return by evening or night without any stress.\n\nPopular Train Options From Ara to Sonpur & Hajipur\n\nHere are some convenient choices for visitors:\n\n1. Ara–Jaynagar Intercity Express\n\nDeparture: 5:40 AM from Ara Junction\n\nArrival: Around 8:20 AM at Hajipur\n\nThis timing works perfectly for travellers who want a full day at Sonpur Mela.\n\n2. Other Local & Express Trains\n\nSeveral local and express trains operate from morning till noon. These trains help visitors plan flexible travel without rushing.\n\n3. Evening & Night Return Trains\n\nIf you love evening shows, theatres, or cultural events at the mela, you can stay longer.Special trains, including the North East Express, start from Hajipur around 4 AM, allowing you to return comfortably even after a late-night visit.\n\nWith so many options, every traveller gets a suitable route and timing.\n\nWhy These Special Trains Matter This Year\n\nThe rush at Sonpur Mela grows every year. Therefore, this new railway plan will help manage crowds, improve safety, and support tourism.It will also help small businesses, local artists, and food vendors attract more visitors.\n\nBecause of these special trains, planning a Sonpur Mela trip has become easier than ever.\n\nFor more verified updates, cultural stories, travel news, and emotional narratives from every corner of the state, follow www.biharsay.com and become part of our fast-growing 13,000+ global community.Bihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, partnering with DailyHunt and known for insightful series like BiharCast—your doorway to the real Bihar.",
